Hellow.

I have  written  cpufreq device  driver for FSB, voltage and multiplier 
changing on nVidia nForce4 -based motherboards.
It is very amateur thing in the present state, i use it primarily for 
overclocking  my dual dualcore Opteron system:). But it may be used for power
saving as well. 

If there will be some interest in this i will continue my work on it and make 
it more robust, though it already works great for me.

I've attached the code.
-- 
Best Regards,
Alexander Shaposhnikov

